<article class="article">
<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Honda Vision vs Honda Air Blade: Hanoi Rental Cost Comparison</h1>
<p>Most head-to-head rental comparisons in Hanoi are settled at the daily rate, where even a small gap compounds over a stay. The Honda Vision and Honda Air Blade refuse that shortcut. Their verified rates agree exactly at 200,000 VND per day and 1,000,000 VND per week, so for anything shorter than a month the price question answers itself: there is no difference to find. The comparison only becomes interesting at the monthly tier, where the two rate cards finally part ways, and not in the direction most renters expect.</p>
<p>This guide lays the two cards side by side using verified figures only, then works out when the choice costs nothing and when it costs 300,000 to 500,000 VND. It builds on the guide to <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a>, the main <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> resource, and the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>. Short version: below a month, pick the machine you like; at a month, read the arithmetic first.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">A comparison decided by the calendar</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">The verified rates side by side</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">Where the two machines agree</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">Where the pricing diverges</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">Short stays: when money is off the table</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">Monthly rentals: the real decision</a></li>
